la secured a surprise win over far-right challenger Flavio Bolsonaro, who has refused to concede. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Why Ukraine may be involved in Mali's conflict</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0ed0ef7bb1497fb734146f8129c26a80baff6690efa1eb98e7d42b24a6e2d9b5</id><updated>2026-10-26T15:19:19Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T14:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-ukraine-may-be-involved-in-mali-s-conflict/a-79743423--7ee87f683a22.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-ukraine-may-be-involved-in-mali-s-conflict/a-79743423?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Allegations that Ukrainian specialists are supporting Tuareg rebels in Mali highlight Kyiv's effort to challenge Russian influence far beyond the battlefield in Europe.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>France: Macron vows 'strong measures' to combat protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:edb6024bba1d263d12435bc7be686f51d14217706e78fdee69aa6b5a7cc5ca49</id><updated>2026-10-26T15:19:22Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T13:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/france-macron-vows-strong-measures-to-combat-protests/a-79764224--32f517bdb1af.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/france-macron-vows-strong-measures-to-combat-protests/a-79764224?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">French President Emmanuel Macron said his government will announce "strong measures" in response to violent protests in France in recent weeks. But he also acknowledged that students have "legitimate" grievances.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's Merz heads to Asia as security issues loom large</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dc9362efbb1386f1042a3a8f60b2ffcbdfcce8127644fb7acc6482585bcce7a6</id><updated>2026-10-26T15:19:26Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T13:32:00Z</publi