bank-land-crossings-on-election-day/a-79755010?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After a deadly attack which killed two Israeli soldiers on Friday, the Israeli military has said all land border points between Israel and the occupied West Bank will be closed during Tuesday's election.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Fire flares up at Hitler's Eagle's Nest retreat</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:66619d770c73b27e4c5a057d6655368305a780241fd1f747b0580723c03db210</id><updated>2026-10-26T15:18:15Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T12:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-fire-flares-up-at-hitler-s-eagle-s-nest-retreat/live-79749353--9bb59e2ba8a3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-fire-flares-up-at-hitler-s-eagle-s-nest-retreat/live-79749353?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Fire broke out again overnight at a former mountain retreat used by Nazi dictator Adolf Hitler. Meanwhile, a survey shows most people in Germany feel the days of the governing coalition are numbered.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>France: Hundreds arrested after nationwide protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:490190885b2485618a0dec41908dc7b504af1fde4dd371744d386209114b8ef0</id><updated>2026-10-26T15:18:15Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T12:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/france-protests-more-violence-feared-amid-renewed-demonstrations/live-79748223--43db314a2270.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/france-hundreds-arrested-after-nationwide-protests/live-79748223?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The French government says more than 1,000 people were arrested following nationwide protests on Saturday. Police and elite security forces were out in force across the country as clashes broke out.</summary><category term