2026-10-25T09:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/gadi-eisenkot-campaigns-on-moroccan-roots-in-challenge-to-netanyahu/a-79747193--b8bf9b894fd4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/gadi-eisenkot-campaigns-on-moroccan-roots-in-challenge-to-netanyahu/a-79747193?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Israel prepares to vote, Gadi Eisenkot is leveraging his Moroccan heritage in Likud strongholds such as Sderot. From historical divides to October 7, identity and trauma are redefining the city's political loyalties.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
